msgstr "Signing up takes a minute. You choose your profile, receive your first Cubis, and the world is yours."

msgid "La monnaie du monde. Tu en gagnes chaque jour, tu en dépenses en boutique, tu en offres aux autres membres. Aucun argent réel n'entre ici."
msgstr "The currency of the world. You earn some every day, spend it in the shop and give it to other members. No real money comes into it."

msgid "La vérification se fait manuellement : ta demande sera traitée dès que possible."
msgstr "Verification is done by hand: your request will be handled as soon as possible."

