msgstr "A permanent world for your community: a profile that looks like you, a game currency, a shop where members' creations are sold, and offerings to thank those who keep the RP alive."

msgid "Utilise ce formulaire si tu n'as plus accès à l'adresse email de ton compte. L'équipe te répondra en privé sur WhatsApp."
msgstr "Use this form if you no longer have access to the email address of your account. The team will reply privately on WhatsApp."

